{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build towers by choosing material, archetype, weapon type, and core purity, which will result in different rarities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own strategies by modifying the routes on the maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Across the maps, you'll find fissures where you can collect materials to craft towers and upgrade equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies will drop crystallized mana and some rare materials needed on different occasions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft towers and upgrade your equipment to overcome difficulties and unravel the mystery of the Land of Anima.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702950?t=1746125726","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/5bd6a658dbea672b2aa4470aab5dcaf3f7c2bc56/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746125726","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/3e3c46857653e5e51e774dc677875e199a6c8b46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746125726","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702950/3e3c46857653e5e51e774dc677875e199a6c8b46/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746125726","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build towers by choosing material, archetype, weapon type, and core purity, which will result in different rarities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own strategies by modifying the routes on the maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Across the maps, you'll find fissures where you can collect materials to craft towers and upgrade equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_para